<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1a237e">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/python-report"><i class="fab fa-python"></i> Python</a>
        <a href="/java-report" class="active"><i class="fab fa-java"></i> Java</a>
        <a href="/ai-report"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> AI</a>
        <a href="/azure-report"><i class="fab fa-microsoft"></i> Azure</a>
        <a href="/powerbi-report"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i> Power BI</a>
        <a href="/calendar"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> Calendar</a>
        <a href="/curriculum"><i class="fas fa-book"></i> Curriculum</a>
    </div>

    <div class="header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="display-4">Java Certification Report</h1>
            <p class="lead">Detailed analysis of Java certification performance</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h2>Overview</h2>
                    <p>This report provides a detailed analysis of the Java certification exam results. The exam was taken by 32 students with a 94% pass rate. The average score was 85.2%.</p>
                    
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h3>Key Findings</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>30 out of 32 students passed the certification exam</li>
                            <li>42% of students scored above 90%</li>
                            <li>The highest score was 98%</li>
                            <li>The lowest score was 62%</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h3>Statistics</h3>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="stat-badge"><i class="fas fa-users"></i> 32 Students</span>
                        <span class="stat-badge"><i class="fas fa-award"></i> 94% Pass Rate</span>
                        <span class="stat-badge"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> 85.2% Avg. Score</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h3>Performance Trends</h3>
                    <p>The Java certification results show strong performance across most areas, with particular strengths in:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Object-Oriented Programming concepts</li>
                        <li>Exception handling</li>
                        <li>Collections framework</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Areas for improvement include:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Concurrency and multithreading</li>
                        <li>Advanced lambda expressions</li>
                        <li>Stream API usage</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h3>Recommendations</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Increase focus on concurrency patterns and multithreading</li>
                        <li>Provide additional practice exercises for functional programming concepts</li>
                        <li>Organize code review sessions to improve code quality awareness</li>
                        <li>Introduce more real-world project scenarios</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h3>Next Steps</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Schedule follow-up workshops on advanced Java topics</li>
                        <li>Prepare specialized material for students who scored below 75%</li>
                        <li>Introduce Spring Framework certification as the next step</li>
                        <li>Organize industry mentorship for top-performing students</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h3>Certification Path</h3>
                    <p>Based on the results, we recommend the following certification path for students:</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Java SE 8 Programmer I (Completed)</li>
                        <li>Java SE 8 Programmer II</li>
                        <li>Spring Professional Certification</li>
                        <li>Oracle Certified Professional: Java EE Developer</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="bg-light py-3 mt-5">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Java Certification Report • Generated by Andre Snell, Senior Facilitator • March 2025</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
